Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you come from the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna sent me to save you and\NBercouli from Emperor Vecta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His death is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were the others safe when you left them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were heading for some ruins,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the Red Knights from\Nmy world are closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll catch up to him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I must co-join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to keep heading south,\Nto the World's End Altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you touch the console—I\Nmean, the crystal panel,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the people on the real-world\Nside will bring you to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor Vecta is dead, is he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone from the real world\Ndies here, they only die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.80,0:01:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my world, they're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vecta was a shell with\Na real worlder in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can destroy the shell, but the person,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one inside, can come\Nback here if they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the villain uncle\Nsacrificed himself to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not really dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has simply vanished and will awaken in\Nyour world alive, as if nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it all for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this death?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying Uncle died in vain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of duel is it, where\Nonly one risks their life?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is no duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is nothing but a farce!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Kirito,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't think his intentions in\Nsuffering are for nothing, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's from the real world too,\Nand it's the same for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he died here, he wouldn't really die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, like, everything\Nhe felt here was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His wounds, the pain he suffered, the\Ndamage to his soul, they're all real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I care about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same goes for Asuna\Nand so many other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we're all hoping and\Npraying he pulls through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,none of us knew why he put himself\Nthrough so much in a world he wasn't from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it for you, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he wanted was to save you, and\Nthat's real, as real as your uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fought with everything he had,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suffered all those wounds, and in the\Nend, he gave his life to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon, if I leave through the World's\NEnd Altar, what becomes of my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the people whom I love?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I be trapped there, or can I return?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can, whenever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you and the\NUnderworld are both safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall head south for the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:03:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part of me still resists this course\Nof action, but they both wished it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle, as well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should go join the others though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that Vecta guy comes back,\NI think he'll come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he does, I'll keep him\Nbusy, buy you a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, and I swear your\Nefforts shall not be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.98,0:05:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The color of your soul is\Nwhat? The color of your soul?
