Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is how I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at least the previous champ won't\Nlaugh when I see him in the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does my heart hurt so?\NI just want to cut him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to savor that battle again\Nfeel it burn down to my core
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:08:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to sever those fists\Nwhich are harder than diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my only desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.64,0:08:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slice and hack and slash away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at the end of your blood-smeared path,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will find the key\Nto breaking your curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, you might.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your service, I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for yours as well, Yoyobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go. Rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sword broke. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not trouble yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, I know why\NI have this compulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To find what I don't want to slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To find what I want to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was fighting toward one goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goal was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish we could have\Nhad a family together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could have had ourselves\Nthe strongest kid ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way stronger than the previous champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strongest pugilist of us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our child would be a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can keep the pressure on, this\Nwill be wrapped up real soon, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't begin to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to thank anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe you like nobody's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck, you and kitty dude always\Nhad my back. It's the least
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:11:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could do by the way um he\Nhere he's safe in a wagon just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down there after this is\Nover you should definitely go
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talk to him maybe one of your\Ndumb jokes will wake him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you're as harsh as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it. Fast pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll pull through, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty, let's switch back\Nin and finish this. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't we seen that guy somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too far away to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with his hood up, I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see his... face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:11:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing... ghosts now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That black cloak?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's a leather poncho.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the leader of Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's PoH.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the players from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please God, no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, we're in for it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This match ain't from America.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're from China and Korea!
