Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to enlist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the army allowed\Natmospheres, I wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Links start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunch of Korean, American, and\NChinese gamers made a new VR game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And their test server has just been\Nhacked by a group of Japanese players.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're attacking the testers right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's always spoiling\Nsomeone else's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bunch of jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.64,0:14:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those big dumb ones are the bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be the Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big red ones must be the testers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're getting hammered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Japanese look like\Nthey're fighting them off.
