Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Amayori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen that video yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Mei-Mei-Shang. Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy, huh? I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and download the\Nclient and let's get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What client?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeking volunteers to help save the testers\Nfrom the vicious Japanese attackers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For anyone who'd like to join,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please download the required\Nclient software to your atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still not sold on the\NJapanese attackers' part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meixiang, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This legit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.12,0:15:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It I don't know yet,\Nbut if what they say is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, then our fellow\Ngamers are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and could use all the help they can get\Nyeah I don't know about that it all sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fishy install the client and find out for\Nyourself I'm diving in now see if I see ya
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got nothing better to do it looks like a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bunch of my friends already dove in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this guy, those\Neyes, a face, I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son, I'm sorry.
