Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in, Higa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bulkhead's maybe a couple\Nminutes down from us still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get to it, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell the guys with\NIchiemon to send him in. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for going with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe you big time when\Nthis is over. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, that's a lot of nerds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many are in there total?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the alarm for the bulkhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's gone and flipped the locks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.18,0:17:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there\Nand check the corridor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The highjackers know about Ichiemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:18:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the maintenance connector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten more meters to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on Kirito's Fluctlight\Nand let you know if anything happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Higa. Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moonphase!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting ready for class.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The terrain looks sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those guys the Japanese players?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of you for\Ndiving in here and helping the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad news is, we're too late to save the\NAlpha Testers in this part of the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were killed out by the\NJapanese a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got them logged back\Nin to another location,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're continuing\Ntheir work from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the Japanese hacked our server,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they got access to all the\Nhigh-spec gear they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're also blocking us\Ndevs from our admin access.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What that means is, we have\Nto fight using default gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's kick them all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's protect our server!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patriots don't need fancy soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, my head's ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like my brain has been taken over.\NHang on, if he's really a devil, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.08,0:19:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could just cut the power to the server
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit this one out, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us have the glory\Nfor once. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been itching for a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheyta!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claps!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claps!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is, the maintenance connector.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matching in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was easier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got Kirito's and Asuna's STLs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the two girls in Roppongi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.84,0:21:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:21:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long have you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,created a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.16,0:22:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so sad that you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to smile on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.20,0:22:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.11,0:22:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.03,0:22:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.94,0:23:27.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}They're connected
